OL,3,GNEWSAStrong wind and rain forecast as
OL,4,Aback-to-back storms hit UK this weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen is causing widespread
OL,7,Ftravel disruption, with strong winds
OL,8,Fand heavy rain reported across the UK
OL,10,FTrains are being hit by cancellations
OL,11,Fand delays due to strong winds and
OL,12,Ffallen trees - here's a rundown of the
OL,13,Fdisruption
OL,15,FNational Grid says it has restored
OL,16,Fpower to more than 60,000 homes, but
OL,17,Fhundreds are still without power in
OL,18,Fparts of England and Wales
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
